    "text": "By Jude Wilkenfeld ,\n18 hours ago This is the Maryland Minute, a short story followed by a roundup of Terps-related news. After days of anticipation following the Sept. 1 recruiting cutoff, Maryland men’s lacrosse signed its first batch of recruits from the high school class of 2028; Noah Benney and CJ Saunders Jr. both committed Tuesday as reported by Inside Lacrosse. Read full article",
